  1106:           
  1107:           C     Wind velocity and atmospheric pressure are read in at all grid
  1108:           C     nodes. Interpolation in time is used to synchronize the wind and
  1109:           C     pressure information with the model time step. Garratt's formula
  1110:           C     is used to compute wind stress from wind velocity.
  1111:                 IF(ABS(NWS).EQ.5) THEN
  1112:                    IF(TimeLoc.GT.WTIME2) THEN
  1113:                       WTIME1=WTIME2
