  1153:           C     Wind velocity and atmospheric pressure are read in for a
  1154:           C     rectangular grid (either in Longitude, Latitude or Cartesian
  1155:           C     coordinates, consistent with the grid coordinates) and
  1156:           C     interpolated in space onto the ADCIRC grid and in time to
  1157:           C     synchronize the wind and pressure information with the model time
  1158:           C     step. Garratt's formula is used to compute wind stress from the
  1159:           C     wind velocity.
  1160:                 IF(NWS.EQ.6) THEN
