  1267:           C
  1268:           C     Wind velocity (10 m) and atmospheric pressure are read in from a
  1269:           C     sequence of National Weather Service (NWS) Aviation (AVN) model
  1270:           C     output files. Each AVN file is assumed to contain data on a
  1271:           C     Gaussian longitude, latitude grid at a single time. Consecutive
  1272:           C     files in the sequence are separated by N hours in time. Garratt's
  1273:           C     formula is used to compute wind stress from the wind velocity.
  1274:                 IF(NWS.EQ.10) THEN
  1275:                    IF(TimeLoc.GT.WTIME2) THEN
  1276:                       WTIME1=WTIME2
  1277:                       WTIME2=WTIME2+WTIMINC
