  1377:           C...  sb46.28sb01 NWS=12 reads in raw OWI files 09/xx/2006
  1378:           C     WJP: Added for NWS = 14 (GRIB2 e.g. CFS)
  1379:                 IF (ABS(NWS).EQ.12.or.ABS(NWS).eq.14) THEN
